title: "fermix: Fast batched determinants and Pfaffians in JAX"
abstract: >-
  Batched slogdet / slogpf / det / pf for float32, float64, complex64 and
  complex128 matrices on NVIDIA GPUs, written in JAX with Pallas (Triton)
  kernels.
